  "notes": "{突|つ}き{止|と}める means to investigate thoroughly until the truth, cause, or identity of something is determined. It implies persistent effort and a conclusive result.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- Takes を for the object being investigated\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{突|つ}き{止|と}めている means 'has ascertained' (resulting state) — the investigation is complete and the answer is known.\n\nCOMMON OBJECTS:\n- {原因|げんいん}を{突|つ}き{止|と}める: ascertain the cause\n- {犯人|はんにん}を{突|つ}き{止|と}める: track down the culprit\n- {真相|しんそう}を{突|つ}き{止|と}める: get to the truth\n- {居場所|いばしょ}を{突|つ}き{止|と}める: track down someone's location\n- {身元|みもと}を{突|つ}き{止|と}める: identify someone's identity",
